  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
    text: 'Archer, you hurt me, and I''m not ready to trust that again. Liam, you''ve been wonderful. But I started all this to get back at someone. I don''t want to love someone because of that.'
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e240942c73318642b0f986813494e10, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 12
      actionType: 0
      coords: {x: -450, y: 0}
