  - sentenceType: 0
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 359f5f6b302fa244c8f52d53c2279cfe, type: 2}
    text: 'You walk home alone, lighter than you''ve felt in weeks, with a sketch of yourself folded in your pocket that Liam pressed into your hand.'
